INSERT INTO posts VALUES("1","SAMPEL SWAB SMA N 1 SUMBER","<div class=\"c1et5uql cxmmr5t8 hcukyx3x ii04i59q kvgmc6g5 oygrvhab\">\n<div dir=\"auto\">Pada hari Jumat, 5 Agustus 2022, telah dilaksanakan sampel swab di SMA N 1 Sumber. Kegiatan ini dilaksanakan dengan mengambil sampel acak yang terdiri 5 guru dan 12 siswa. Total ada 17 orang sampel swab. Petugas pengambil sampel swab dari Puskesmas Sumber langsung datang ke sekolah. Alhamdulillah, dari 17 orang sampel, hasilnya dinyatakan negatif.</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"c1et5uql cxmmr5t8 hcukyx3x ii04i59q o9v6fnle oygrvhab\">\n<div dir=\"auto\">Salam sehat. *wr</div>\n\n<div dir=\"auto\">.</div>\n\n<div dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/sman1s?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZXhqoJYD88Rc4ihyViwa6E9t8QJn4vUGsLGtcyAPmKnXb_We8cLDAJvIxONpfIrR1761ehciGO4l8ZzR2VwtodzuHhmGCXrLkj-aqF9QLk71Vq9a3lGVr1PtqGyJc1MTv6BgH0uEXrwlugBG914SDpNJ1kwTzv4iXGHx1Eu7KNTtA&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" tabindex=\"0\">#SMAN1S</a></div>\n\n<div dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/sman1sjaya?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZXhqoJYD88Rc4ihyViwa6E9t8QJn4vUGsLGtcyAPmKnXb_We8cLDAJvIxONpfIrR1761ehciGO4l8ZzR2VwtodzuHhmGCXrLkj-aqF9QLk71Vq9a3lGVr1PtqGyJc1MTv6BgH0uEXrwlugBG914SDpNJ1kwTzv4iXGHx1Eu7KNTtA&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" tabindex=\"0\">#SMAN1SJAYA</a></div>\n</div>\n","1778288515_69fe8783813d7.png","2022-08-05 07:04:39");
INSERT INTO posts VALUES("2","PPDB 2020 Telah Dibuka","<div class=\"_xlr\">\n<div id=\"id_5ecbf2aa9513b8c84062631\" class=\"text_exposed_root text_exposed\">SMA Negeri 1 Sumber\nTelah membuka Penerimaan Peserta Didik Baru (PPDB 2020)\nGratis biaya pendaftaran!\nGabung sekarang juga!\nSilahkan isi link pendataan.<span class=\"text_exposed_show\"><span class=\"text_exposed_show\">\n<a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/PPDB-SMAN1SUMBER?fbclid=IwAR3dnPaYBueyVNbrPEARKmN3ejzv390PuLDE4DpItxanOcNyHC2dhQ7Vq5I\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" data-lynx-mode=\"asynclazy\" data-lynx-uri=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Ftinyurl.com%2FPPDB-SMAN1SUMBER%3Ffbclid%3DIwAR3dnPaYBueyVNbrPEARKmN3ejzv390PuLDE4DpItxanOcNyHC2dhQ7Vq5I&amp;h=AT3suS7cdXbmiNp4Tn0COm-3uMDhR7q0-23kWS2TJxFhR30CfngfgaUTlUA3IK7I34G6YbDDJ4ebjM9pFEMkUMr41YbsCRufcLDXhyQyf_wBgZkMlVBNqalA4mZt60tJ-qkcnhokEVvD\">https://tinyurl.com/<wbr />PPDB-SMAN1SUMBER</a></span></span>Jangan lupa gabung di group WA untuk mendapatkan info selanjutnya\n<a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/grup-ppdb-sman1s?fbclid=IwAR3T4ZW1XMX0GzYCOQlruEpohXq5R0K88IWdZzOBGkJsH1X13GOuhgunFW4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" data-lynx-mode=\"asynclazy\" data-lynx-uri=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Ftinyurl.com%2Fgrup-ppdb-sman1s%3Ffbclid%3DIwAR3T4ZW1XMX0GzYCOQlruEpohXq5R0K88IWdZzOBGkJsH1X13GOuhgunFW4&amp;h=AT3oGjKG794grsslczvyycBp-z19-I0Y3FWFSbbMcgx5AdQNgBYfTa2BMgDJGvs2YbrrfA9Eyd-28eiWUgGapepjaTzAJr_NOdNFAY7vGqC7j8MEm9hrV-4AWdQ6zr6o08n78nNPnfKv\">https://tinyurl.com/<wbr />grup-ppdb-sman1s</a><a class=\"_58cn\" href=\"https://web.facebook.com/hashtag/sma?epa=HASHTAG\" data-ft=\"{&quot;type&quot;:104,&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;*N&quot;}\">#SMA</a> Maju Bersama Hebat Semua!!!\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n\n[caption id=\"attachment_18\" align=\"alignnone\" width=\"1168\"]<img class=\"wp-image-18 size-full\" src=\"https://sma1sumber.sch.id/ledok/uploads/2020/05/95016104_2649616078632075_52830177